  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.05 “Chip” means a non-metal or partly metal representative of value issued by a licensee for use at table games at the licensee’s gaming establishment.\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.04)",
